<#entry-task-05-goal-01> a schema:Comment;
    dct:created "2026-10-24T19:26:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    schema:text "When the background creation of a picked create entry fails, the failure is communicated in an accessible way, not only as a document-level CustomEvent.".
<#entry-task-05-context-01> a schema:Comment;
    dct:created "2026-10-24T19:26:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    schema:text "Today the failure path dispatches pod-os:error on document, which the error toast renders; whether that surface is announced to screen readers is unverified — the task must check and close that gap.".
<#entry-task-05-scope-01> a schema:Comment;
    dct:created "2026-10-24T19:26:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    schema:text "Verify how pos-error-toast surfaces the failure to assistive technology (live region or focus move); if it is silent to AT, wire an accessible announcement for the error and reuse that mechanism.".
<#entry-task-05-verification-01> a schema:Comment;
    dct:created "2026-10-24T19:26:12Z"^^xsd:dateTime;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <../agents.ttl#llm-glm-5.3-flash>;
    schema:text "Spec coverage that the failure path reaches the accessible announcement mechanism; existing processSelectedMention specs stay green.".
